{"id":"1895c20f7dacd11c","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence.md","title":"Theorem — Flatness is Filtering and its Finite Limit Specialization","display":"Theorem — Flatness is Filtering and its Finite Limit Specialization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence","aliases":["14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence"],"display":"Theorem — Flatness is Filtering and its Finite Limit Specialization","depends_on":["[[14-df-flat-set-functor]]","[[14-df-filtering-set-functor]]","[[14-df-set-functor-tensor]]","[[14-thm-representable-tensor]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","source_locator":"VII.6 Theorem 3、公式 (2)、Corollary 4，印刷页 386–390；DjVu 第 199–201 图页"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Flatness is Filtering and its Finite Limit Specialization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87956cc8ea885899\" href=\"?note=87956cc8ea885899\" title=\"14-df-flat-set-functor\">14-df-flat-set-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"230c16dff32f677b\" href=\"?note=230c16dff32f677b\" title=\"14-df-filtering-set-functor\">14-df-filtering-set-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"decc9a8183e886fb\" href=\"?note=decc9a8183e886fb\" title=\"14-df-set-functor-tensor\">14-df-set-functor-tensor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"769638b12e2bdfd0\" href=\"?note=769638b12e2bdfd0\" title=\"14-thm-representable-tensor\">14-thm-representable-tensor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"VII.6 Theorem 3、公式 (2)、Corollary 4，印刷页 386–390；DjVu 第 199–201 图页"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 是协变函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,C&#39;\">\\(C,C&#39;\\)</span> 是对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in R(C)\">\\(r\\in R(C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&#39;\\in R(C&#39;)\">\\(r&#39;\\in R(C&#39;)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A(C)\">\\(a\\in A(C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&#39;\\in A(C&#39;)\">\\(a&#39;\\in A(C&#39;)\\)</span>。张量商中的代表携带所属对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsFilteringSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsFilteringSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\to\\bigl([(C,r,a)]=[(C&#39;,r&#39;,a&#39;)]\\leftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\ \\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C&#39;)\\ \\exists b\\in A(B)\\\n(A(u)(b)=a\\land A(v)(b)=a&#39;\\land R(u)(r)=R(v)(r&#39;))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsLeftExact}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsFilteringSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsFilteringSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\to\\bigl([(C,r,a)]=[(C&#39;,r&#39;,a&#39;)]\\leftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\ \\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C&#39;)\\ \\exists b\\in A(B)\\\n(A(u)(b)=a\\land A(v)(b)=a&#39;\\land R(u)(r)=R(v)(r&#39;))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsLeftExact}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>原书定位：VII.6 Theorem 3、公式 (2)、Corollary 4，印刷页 386–390；DjVu 第 199–201 图页。</p>\n<p>原书证明已读。先证明所写共同提升关系自反、对称；传递性由元素范畴中有限图有锥，把两个见证同时细化，故该关系就是张量的生成等价关系。若张量函子左正合，终对象的像非空给 (i)，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"yC\\times yD\">\\(yC\\times yD\\)</span> 的张量到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(C)\\times A(D)\">\\(A(C)\\times A(D)\\)</span> 的满性给 (ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y(u),y(v)\">\\(y(u),y(v)\\)</span> 的等化子张量给 (iii)。反向，(i) 与 (ii) 说明终对象的张量恰一元素；对预层拉回，共同提升公式先把两个张量代表细化到同一对象并满足拉回方程，给比较映射的满性；再对两组相等见证取元素范畴中的共同锥，给单性。所以张量保终对象与拉回，因而左正合。最后，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 有有限极限，flatness 加 Yoneda 保极限推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 左正合；反向分别用终对象、二元积及平行箭头等化子提供 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"230c16dff32f677b\" href=\"?note=230c16dff32f677b\" title=\"14-df-filtering-set-functor\">14-df-filtering-set-functor</a> 三种见证。空范畴上张量是空集，不能保终对象，亦不 filtering。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-flat-set-functor","status":"resolved","id":"87956cc8ea885899","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-flat-set-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-filtering-set-functor","status":"resolved","id":"230c16dff32f677b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-filtering-set-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-set-functor-tensor","status":"resolved","id":"decc9a8183e886fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-set-functor-tensor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-representable-tensor","status":"resolved","id":"769638b12e2bdfd0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-representable-tensor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-filtering-set-functor","status":"resolved","id":"230c16dff32f677b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书证明已读。先证明所写共同提升关系自反、对称；传递性由元素范畴中有限图有锥，把两个见证同时细化，故该关系就是张量的生成等价关系。若张量函子左正合，终对象的像非空给 (i)，$yC\\times yD$ 的张量到 $A(C)\\times A(D)$ 的满性给 (ii)，$y(u),y(v)$ 的等化子张量给 (iii)。反向，(i) 与 (ii) 说明终对象的张量恰一元素；对预层拉回，共同提升公式先把两个张量代表细化到同一对象并满足拉回方程，给比较映射的满性；再对两组相等见证取元素范畴中的共同锥，给单性。所以张量保终对象与拉回，因而左正合。最后，若 $\\mathcal C$ 有有限极限，flatness 加 Yoneda 保极限推出 $A$ 左正合；反向分别用终对象、二元积及平行箭头等化子提供 [[14-df-filtering-set-functor]] 三种见证。空范畴上张量是空集，不能保终对象，亦不 filtering。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"C,C'","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in R(C)","display":false},{"tex":"r'\\in R(C')","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A(C)","display":false},{"tex":"a'\\in A(C')","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{IsFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsFilteringSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsFilteringSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\to\\bigl([(C,r,a)]=[(C',r',a')]\\leftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\ \\exists v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C')\\ \\exists b\\in A(B)\\\n(A(u)(b)=a\\land A(v)(b)=a'\\land R(u)(r)=R(v)(r'))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasFiniteLimits}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsFlatSetFunctor}(A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsLeftExact}(A,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"yC\\times yD","display":false},{"tex":"A(C)\\times A(D)","display":false},{"tex":"y(u),y(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":2861,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence|Theorem — Flatness is Filtering and its Finite Limit Specialization]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence]]"},{"id":"87956cc8ea885899","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"flatness 的定义是张量函子保持有限极限，不是把 $A$ 本身保有限极限直接当成定义；只有在 $\\mathcal C$ 有有限极限时，后一性质才与 flatness 等价，见 [[14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence]]。$T_A$ 已由 [[14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction]] 有右伴随，所以自动保持余极限，而左正合性是额外要求。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-257","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-flat-filtering-equivalence|Theorem — Flatness is Filtering and its Finite Limit Specialization]]"}],"outgoing":["87956cc8ea885899","230c16dff32f677b","decc9a8183e886fb","769638b12e2bdfd0","4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","99b72d10a7d872f5"]}